        - Output: :math:`(N, C_{out}, L_{out})` or :math:`(C_{out}, L_{out})`, where

          .. math::
              L_{out} = (L_{in} - 1) \times \text{stride} - 2 \times \text{padding} + \text{dilation}
                        \times (\text{kernel\_size} - 1) + \text{output\_padding} + 1

